view, Then an entry\n55\t  point is available that opens the run comparison populated with the linked\n56\t  run.\n57\t- Given a model version without run lineage, When its view is opened, Then no\n58\t  broken entry point is rendered and no error occurs.\n59\t- Given the linked run is opened for comparison, Then the same side-by-side\n60\t  and diff presentations are available as when comparing from the runs list.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-2 (P1): a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry (Dashboard\n65\t  UI portion of the requirement).\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5e75b0941e32a53","agent_id":"a5f13e512b318cd1a","session_id":"bfa11520-8a30-46f6-a648-bb273d1f61ab","uuid":"f31adaa4-a6c1-40c9-99bb-bcd206edceae","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:44:37.912Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-be04d3c02ea612f0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
